.TH GJALLARHORN\-LISTENER 1 "2026-10-29" "unheaded b06c570c" "Unheaded Kingdom"
.SH NAME
gjallarhorn\-listener \- Receive UPC trigger packets (Gjallarhorn) and print them; Mímir's Law phase 9 validation tool.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B gjallarhorn\-listener
[\fIOPTION\fR]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Receive UPC trigger packets (Gjallarhorn) and print them; Mímir's Law phase 9 validation tool.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-iface \fISTRING\fR
interface for multicast (default eth0)
.TP
.B \-\-listen \fISTRING\fR
listen address (unicast) (default ::)
.TP
.B \-\-mcast\-addr \fISTRING\fR
multicast group (default ff02::1:abba)
.TP
.B \-\-multicast
join link\-local multicast group
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
display this help and exit
.TP
.B \-V, \-\-version
output version information and exit
.SH EXAMPLES
.EX
gjallarhorn\-listener \-\-iface eth0
.EE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR unheaded (1)
